  "solution": "Given:\n\n(15, 45, 90)\n\n(8, 24, 48)\n\nLogic: Third no. = [(First no. × 3) + (Second no.)]\n\n**(15, 45, 90) →**\n\n⇒ [(15 × 3) + 45]\n\n⇒ (45 + 45) = 90\n\n**(8, 24, 48) →**\n\n⇒ [(8 × 3) + 24]\n\n⇒ (24 + 24) = 48\n\nChecking all the given options:\n\n1. (9, 27, 45) →\n\n⇒ [(9 × 3) + 27]\n\n⇒ (27 + 27) = 54\n\n2. (7, 21, 24) →\n\n⇒ [(7 × 3) + 21]\n\n⇒ (21 + 21) = 42\n\n3. **(6, 18, 36) →**\n\n⇒ [(6 × 3) + 18]\n\n⇒ (18 + 18) =** 36**\n\n4. (12, 36, 68) →\n\n⇒ [(12 × 3) + 36]\n\n⇒ (36 + 36) = 72\n\nHere, (9, 2, 72) shows a similar relation to the given set of numbers.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option (3)\".",
